    "task_signature": "general/空间计算",
    "question_feat": "针对 construction_areas 表中 code 为 A001 和 A008 的两个面要素，分别计算：1）两区面积直接相加（平方米）；2）两区联合覆盖去重面积（平方米）；3）两区重叠面积（平方米）。联合覆盖与直接相加复用同一份区域查询结果。",
    "plan": {
      "t1": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "id": "s1",
            "action": "query_features",
            "params": {
              "table": "construction_areas",
              "filters": {
                "code": [
                  "A001",
                  "A008"
                ]
              },
              "output": "features_A001_A008"
            },
            "depends_on": []
          },
          {
            "id": "s2",
            "action": "measure_geometry",
            "params": {
              "input": "features_A001_A008",
              "mode": "per_feature_area",
              "unit": "square_meter",
              "output": "areas_per_feature"
            },
            "depends_on": [
              "s1"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "s3",
            "action": "calculate_sum",
            "params": {
              "input": "areas_per_feature",
              "output": "sum_area_direct"
            },
            "depends_on": [
              "s2"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "s4",
            "action": "union_features",
            "params": {
              "input": "features_A001_A008",
              "output": "union_geom"
            },
            "depends_on": [
              "s1"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "s5",
            "action": "measure_geometry",
            "params": {
              "input": "union_geom",
              "mode": "area",
              "unit": "square_meter",
              "output": "union_area"
            },
            "depends_on": [
              "s4"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "s6",
            "action": "calculate_difference",
            "params": {
              "input_a": "sum_area_direct",
              "input_b": "union_area",
              "output": "overlap_area"
            },
            "depends_on": [
              "s3",
              "s5"
            ]
          }
        ],
